    {
      "id": "cg5XhIE37IfUghBP814fe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1019.216514330605,
      "y": 7373.197812053991,
      "width": 537.4132080078125,
      "height": 164.75898394601043,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 879731288,
      "version": 2132,
      "versionNonce": 1572561448,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788198156077,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- if not custom alies then \n    - each server will get unique local counter ( 1,2 3) of its own.\n    - each server will get there unique worker id by zoookeeper distributed store.\n    - server form shortCode for each url as snowflake id which will give a unique  shortCode \n      and this will be mapped against the original url\n     - (snowflake id) 1 bit signed + 41 bit server timestamp + 10 bit worker id + 12 bit unique counter\n    -  Then this key will be hash using MD5 , sha256 then stored into db \n    -  snowflakeId = 1234567890123456 => base62(snowflakeId)\n    -   example of url:  www.bitly/5Gk2mQ\n    \n- custom alies alieas given by user example world4u",
      "fontSize": 11.98247155970985,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- if not custom alies then \n    - each server will get unique local counter ( 1,2 3) of its own.\n    - each server will get there unique worker id by zoookeeper distributed store.\n    - server form shortCode for each url as snowflake id which will give a unique  shortCode \n      and this will be mapped against the original url\n     - (snowflake id) 1 bit signed + 41 bit server timestamp + 10 bit worker id + 12 bit unique counter\n    -  Then this key will be hash using MD5 , sha256 then stored into db \n    -  snowflakeId = 1234567890123456 => base62(snowflakeId)\n    -   example of url:  www.bitly/5Gk2mQ\n    \n- custom alies alieas given by user example world4u",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
