    {
      "id": "wc-RumQcT0msksfr3KTcv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -70.34169380892,
      "y": 7314.501837524478,
      "width": 376.12884521484375,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b07",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 684556584,
      "version": 73,
      "versionNonce": 1301140008,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788197891533,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\n* Create a short URL from a long URL\n* Create a short URL with a custom alias (paid tier)\n* Set an expiration date on a short URL\n* Redirect from short URL to the original URL\n* View click analytics for a URL (count, referrer, geo)\n* Delete a short URL",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\n* Create a short URL from a long URL\n* Create a short URL with a custom alias (paid tier)\n* Set an expiration date on a short URL\n* Redirect from short URL to the original URL\n* View click analytics for a URL (count, referrer, geo)\n* Delete a short URL",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2Xat4ElI_ryMpBF6uQDGl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -70.34169433291842,
      "y": 7494.731239310788,
      "width": 472.3529968261719,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b08",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 292150824,
      "version": 105,
      "versionNonce": 1935756584,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788197891533,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. NON-FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\n* CAP Theorem: Availability for redirects (stale reads acceptable).\n  Consistency for alias creation (no two users get the same alias).\n* Scale & Assumptions:\n* DAU: 100M\n* URLs created per day: 100M\n* Redirects per day: 10B\n* Read-to-Write Ratio: 100:1\n* Peak factor: 10x average\n* Write QPS: 1.2k average, 12k peak\n* Read QPS: 115k average, 1.15M peak\n* Redirect latency: p99 < 50 ms\n* Create latency: p99 < 200 ms\n* Short code must be globally unique and non-enumerable\n* Availability target: 99.99% on the redirect path",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. NON-FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\n* CAP Theorem: Availability for redirects (stale reads acceptable).\n  Consistency for alias creation (no two users get the same alias).\n* Scale & Assumptions:\n* DAU: 100M\n* URLs created per day: 100M\n* Redirects per day: 10B\n* Read-to-Write Ratio: 100:1\n* Peak factor: 10x average\n* Write QPS: 1.2k average, 12k peak\n* Read QPS: 115k average, 1.15M peak\n* Redirect latency: p99 < 50 ms\n* Create latency: p99 < 200 ms\n* Short code must be globally unique and non-enumerable\n* Availability target: 99.99% on the redirect path",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KFwv35niBKMm6QYgXXTNa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -70.34169437571832,
      "y": 7834.9095272565455,
      "width": 276.5285949707031,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
